{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302190","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130219001:1":{"text":"응, 오우거는 블랙하울의 족장이기도 하고, 내가 가장 존경하고 좋아하는 전사야.","source_cn":"是的，奥格身为黑嚎的族长，他一直是我最尊敬和喜欢的强者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BA861F84511F9A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130219002:1":{"text":"아직 브루투스를 이긴 적은 없지만, 그럼에도 오우거는 포기하지 않았어. 계속해서 군가 축제에 참가해 그에게 도전하고 있지.","source_cn":"虽然之前的他一直没有战胜布鲁特斯，可他仍然坚持参加这届...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB7B0CAB72A9C365","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130219003:1":{"text":"포기하지 않는 불굴의 정신... 전사가 가져야 할 최고의 덕목이지!","source_cn":"永不言败——这才是一名勇士最重要的品质！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49054162FA4EA474","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血迪拉夫":{"text":"딜라프","source":"蛮血迪拉夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}